h1(O(H)) = h2(O(H)) = 0,
Ext1(I_(p_*)(-H),O) = C.
```

The nonzero class in (1) is locally free by the Hartshorne-Serre criterion:
the Cayley-Bacharach system `|K_K3-H|=|-H|` is empty. Since
`H^2/2=[p_*]`, its exact character is

```text
ch(I_(p_*)(-H)) = (1-[p_*]) exp(-H) = 1-H,
ch(E_-) = 2-H.
```

Define

```text
